0:{"buildId":"vU9imYCx60Wv-EVSe9Cp5","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"pb-16 text-brand-ink","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"F1 / OPT 留学生可以开公司吗？身份合规完整指南\",\"description\":\"F1 / OPT / STEM OPT 留学生能不能开公司的身份合规解析，附风险自测工具。\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MapleWorld\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MapleWorld\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://www.mapleworld.online/compliance/can-f1-open-company\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"F1 学生可以注册一家公司吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"注册公司本身（比如登记一家 LLC）通常不等于「工作」，很多情况下作为纯被动股东是相对可行的。但一旦你开始参与经营、管理，或者从公司领取任何形式的报酬，就可能被认定为工作授权之外的雇佣行为。具体是否可行，取决于你的身份阶段和参与程度，建议用本文的自测工具先做初步判断，再找移民律师确认。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"OPT 期间开公司，会不会影响 OPT 的专业相关性要求？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"如果你打算通过自己的公司满足 OPT 的雇佣和专业相关性要求（比如给自己发工资、把公司当作 OPT 雇主），需要格外谨慎——这类操作对雇主关系和岗位真实性的要求比普通雇佣更高，容易被认定为不符合要求。建议在采取行动前书面确认。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"被动股东和主动经营，具体怎么区分？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"简单理解：只出钱、不参与日常决策、不从公司领取报酬，通常更接近被动投资；只要你开始处理日常运营、做决策、或者领取工资/顾问费，就更接近「工作」。边界不总是非黑即白，这也是建议咨询移民律师而不是自行判断的原因。\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"开公司之后还要注意报税身份的变化吗？\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"会。开公司之后的报税方式（比如是否需要填 W8BEN）跟你之前单纯拿工资/奖学金时不一样，这部分我们会在本系列的 W8BEN 解析中详细展开。\"}}]}"}}],["$","section",null,{"className":"px-4 py-12 sm:py-16","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"page-shell","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_300px] gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"min-w-0","children":[["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"mb-6","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"身份合规专区\",\"item\":\"https://www.mapleworld.online/compliance\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"能否开公司\"}]}"}}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-ink/50","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-brand-pinkdeep transition-colors","children":"首页"}]}],[["$","$1","0",{"children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"select-none","children":"/"}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/compliance","className":"hover:text-brand-pinkdeep transition-colors","children":"身份合规专区"}]}]]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"select-none","children":"/"}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-ink/80 font-medium","children":"能否开公司"}]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-brand-ink/50","children":"Compliance / 身份合规"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight","children":"F1 / OPT 留学生可以开公司吗？身份合规完整指南"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 text-lg text-brand-ink/80 leading-relaxed","children":["这个问题没有一个「能」或「不能」的简单答案。",["$","br",null,{}],"真正决定风险高低的，是你打算",["$","strong",null,{"children":"怎么参与"}],"这家公司——是纯粹出资的被动股东， 还是要亲自参与经营、给自己发工资。这篇文章会先帮你判断自己属于哪一类，再讲清楚每个阶段该注意什么。"]}],["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-pink max-w-none mt-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6 text-brand-ink","children":"被动股东 vs 主动经营——这是能不能开的关键分界线"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-brand-ink/75 leading-7","children":["F1 / OPT 身份的核心限制是「工作授权」，也就是你只能在授权范围内的雇主/岗位下工作。 开公司这件事本身不违反任何规则，真正的风险点在于：",["$","strong",null,{"children":"你在公司里扮演的角色是不是构成了「工作」"}],"。"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"]}],"$Lf"]}],"$L10"]}]}]}]]}],["$L11"],"$L12"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
4:["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-emerald-700 mb-2","children":"相对低风险"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-brand-ink/80 leading-relaxed","children":"只出资、不参与日常决策、不从公司领取任何报酬，通常更接近「被动投资」， 和你需要工作授权才能做的「工作」是两回事。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-red-600 mb-2","children":"高风险"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-brand-ink/80 leading-relaxed","children":"参与日常经营管理，或者给自己发工资/顾问费，都容易被认定为在从事工作授权之外的雇佣活动。"}]]}]]}]
5:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6 text-brand-ink","children":"F1 / CPT / OPT / STEM OPT 各阶段的具体差异"}]
6:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-brand-ink/75 leading-7","children":"不同身份阶段对「工作」的定义和限制并不完全一样："}]
7:["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-3 text-brand-ink/80 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"F1 在读（未开始 CPT/OPT）："}],"原则上不允许校外工作，纯被动投资的空间相对大一些，但一旦涉及经营或领薪，风险很高。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"CPT："}],"工作授权和课程/实习安排绑定得很紧，用自己的公司满足 CPT 要求容易被认定为不符合授权范围。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"OPT / STEM OPT："}],"对雇主和岗位的专业相关性要求较高，自雇/自己开公司给自己发工资是最容易被审查的场景之一。"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"已转 H1B / 绿卡："}],"规则体系完全不同，H1B 有雇主绑定要求，绿卡持有者限制则少得多，不适用本文的判断框架。"]}]]}]
8:["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6 text-brand-ink","children":"常见误区：\"我朋友这么干了没事\""}]
9:["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-[20px] bg-brand-pink/10 p-6 my-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-brand-ink/80 leading-relaxed","children":"身份合规问题很少在当下就暴露，往往是在申请 OPT 延期、H1B 或绿卡的时候才被追溯审查。 「朋友这么干了没事」大概率只是还没到审查节点，而不是这个操作真的安全。 身份问题和报税问题最大的区别是：报税报错了通常可以事后补救，身份问题一旦被认定， 补救空间要小得多。"}]}]
